<ul>
  <li><a href="/compare/notion-vs-appflowy-vs-affine/">Notion vs AppFlowy vs AFFiNE</a>, if your team uses Notion rather than Confluence (includes a real AFFiNE self-host test)</li>
  <li><a href="/alternatives/notion/">Open-source Notion alternatives</a></li>
  <li><a href="/category/knowledge-base/">All open-source knowledge base and wiki tools</a></li>
</ul>
</div></section>
